# Examples that are known to fail the audit.
#
# The audit runs every example in examples/pyash through the real runner and
# gates on regressions: a failure that is listed here keeps being reported but
# does not fail the run, and any failure that is not listed fails the run.
#
# Remove an entry once its example passes; the audit reports the ones that
# have been fixed so the list stays honest.
#
# The list is empty. The agent turn-id defect that once filled it is fixed:
# an exchange sentence id names a position in a run, so the turn id now adds
# the session-local ordinal and every ask gets its own turn.
#
# su name known_failures ob ve text "example.pya" ya
su name known_failures ob ve text ya
prah
